[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 543.59, "timestamp": "00:09:03", "text": "呃，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 545.99, "timestamp": "00:09:05", "text": "通过和他们所有人交谈的方式邀请我过新年。 有时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 549.75, "timestamp": "00:09:09", "text": "直播的时候如果没有观众，大家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 552.47, "timestamp": "00:09:12", "text": "自言自语就很糟糕。[音乐] 我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 557.75, "timestamp": "00:09:17", "text": "和你聊天，别担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 561.03, "timestamp": "00:09:21", "text": "我能理解。   是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 564.55, "timestamp": "00:09:24", "text": "有人陪伴真的很有帮助"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 565.269, "timestamp": "00:09:25", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 568.949, "timestamp": "00:09:28", "text": "好的，关于模型还有一个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 589.509, "timestamp": "00:09:49", "text": "是啊，2D动画确实很漂亮"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 591.11, "timestamp": "00:09:51", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 595.99, "timestamp": "00:09:55", "text": "用 2D 实时图像可以做很多事情，但用 3D 实时图像更"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 598.63, "timestamp": "00:09:58", "text": "实用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 599.67, "timestamp": "00:09:59", "text": "我猜"}]